# UNERA V2 — Flow stepper (action pages)

**Scope:** Every multi-step **action flow** under `NewUnera/` (Send, Add Money, Exchange, Get/Redeem CAD, KYC, password reset, stake, MFA enroll, etc.).

**Canonical reference:** [`NewUnera/send-enhanced.html`](../NewUnera/send-enhanced.html) — desktop stepper CSS (~L426–515), markup (~L1646–1685), `updateStepperAndMobile()` (~L2128+).

**Related:** [`.cursor/rules/newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc`](newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc), [`.cursor/rules/newunera-color-system.mdc`](newunera-color-system.mdc) §7.3, [`.cursor/rules/wallet-action-pages.mdc`](wallet-action-pages.mdc).

---

## Placement & rail

- **DOM path:** `main#main-content > div.stepper` (sibling of `.page-header`, above `.step-content` panels).
- **Width:** `max-width: 700px`; `margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto`; `padding: 0 1rem`; `margin-bottom: 3rem`.
- **Height:** ~82px total (48px circle + 0.75rem gap + label) — do not fix height; let content define it.

Pair with **`.mobile-stepper-compact`** on the same rail (`max-width: 700px`). Hide desktop `.stepper` at **`max-width: 640px`** (or 768px where the page already uses that breakpoint); show compact stepper.

---

## Markup contract

```html
<div class="stepper" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="1">
  <div class="stepper-progress" id="stepperProgress" style="width:0%"></div>
  <div class="step active" data-step="1">
    <div class="step-circle">1</div>
    <div class="step-label">Choose Method</div>
  </div>
  <!-- repeat .step per visible flow step -->
</div>
```

| Element | Rule |
|--------|------|
| `.stepper` | `role="progressbar"`; sync `aria-valuenow` / `aria-valuemax` to **visible** step count |
| `.stepper-progress` | First child; width = `(stepperIndex / (totalVisible - 1)) * 100%`; **100%** when flow is fully complete |
| `.step` | `data-step` = internal content step id; optional `.hidden` to omit prereqs |
| `.step-circle` | 48×48px circle; number **or** stroked check (never both) |
| `.step-label` | Short title under circle (e.g. Choose Method, Recipient, Amount, Confirm, Success) |

Optional: `id="dynamicStepper"` when built in JS — class names and structure stay the same.

---

## Visual states

| State | `.step-circle` | `.step-label` |
|-------|----------------|---------------|
| Pending | white bg, `border: 2px solid var(--neutral-300)`, step number | `var(--neutral-600)` |
| **Active** | `background: var(--brand-deep-blue)`, white number, `transform: scale(1.1)` | `var(--brand-deep-blue)`, weight 600 |
| **Completed** | `background: var(--brand-deep-blue)`, **stroked `unera-checkmark`** (22×22), no number | **`var(--fin-up)`**, weight 500 |

- Track: `.stepper::before` → `var(--neutral-300)`; fill: `.stepper-progress` → **`var(--brand-deep-blue)`** (no CSS gradients).
- Completed check: `UNERA_CHECKMARK_SVG` constant — see [newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc](newunera-checkmark-icon.mdc). `innerHTML` for completed; `textContent = String(n)` for active/pending.

---

## JS behavior (required)

1. **Renumber visible steps** — when early steps are `.hidden`, display **1…N** in circles (not raw `data-step` ids).
2. **Completed &lt; active &lt; pending** — prior steps get `.completed` + check; current gets `.active` + number; later stay pending + number.
3. **Hidden steps** — use `.step.hidden { display: none }`; `aria-valuemax` = count of **visible** steps only.
4. **Processing / success content steps** — when content steps outnumber stepper nodes (e.g. Send: stepper ends at “Success” but content has Processing + Success panels), map explicitly:
   - **Processing** → last stepper node **active**
   - **Final success** → all stepper nodes **completed** + checks, progress **100%**, `aria-valuenow = totalVisible`
5. **Mobile compact** — keep `#mobileStepNumber`, `#mobileCurrentStep`, `#mobileTotalSteps`, `#mobileStepTitle`, `#mobileStepCounter` in sync with the same `stepperIndex` logic.

