## Mobile compact stepper

```html
<div class="mobile-stepper-compact">
  <div class="mobile-step-current">
    <div class="mobile-step-circle" id="mobileStepNumber">1</div>
    <div class="mobile-step-info">
      <div class="mobile-step-label">Step <span id="mobileCurrentStep">1</span> of <span id="mobileTotalSteps">5</span></div>
      <div class="mobile-step-title" id="mobileStepTitle">Choose Method</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-step-counter" id="mobileStepCounter">1/5</div>
</div>
```

Copy styles from `send-enhanced.html` / `add-money.html`. Mobile circle uses **`var(--brand-deep-blue)`** fill (not legacy gradient greens).

---

## Do not

- ❌ Unicode `✓` or filled Material check inside `.step-circle`
- ❌ Leave numbers on **completed** steps when a check is shown
- ❌ Hardcode hex colors — use `--brand-deep-blue`, `--fin-up`, `--neutral-*` tokens
- ❌ `linear-gradient` on stepper track, circles, or progress fill
- ❌ Stepper wider than 700px or left-aligned without centering on the flow rail
- ❌ Reset all circles to numbers on the final success step (broken `indexOf === -1` bug)

---

## When updating existing pages

Align **`add-money.html`**, **`exchange.html`**, **`get-unera-cad.html`**, **`redeem-unera-cad.html`**, **`kyc-verify.html`**, and other flows to this contract when touching their stepper. Prefer **copying CSS + JS patterns from `send-enhanced.html`** over one-off variants.
